    <item>
      <title>Nvidia Halts Sales to Southeast Asia as U.S. Tightens China Restrictions</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/nvidia-southeast-asia-sales.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/nvidia-southeast-asia-sales.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:04:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>The shipping halt, which hit four countries, follows a new U.S. rule that would require licenses for companies in the countries to buy advanced A.I. chips.</description>
